{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在心理因果解释和段落之间的叙事衔接上不如Y充分，尤其S05—S07及S11之后，Y更容易让观众明白人物为什么发生变化。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X的短句、关键词高亮让观众边听边扫时更容易迅速抓住每段核心，感受词按音乐小节出现，也能把音乐的力度、音色、推进、停顿和情绪变化呈现得更细致。Y的叙事解释更充分，前后心理转折也更连贯，但较长的句子增加了即时阅读负担，部分音乐细节也被概括掉了。综合实际观看时的可读性、要点捕捉和音乐感受的具体程度，我选X。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5f329655-b839-4ed4-89a9-a9cf5240715f", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T085934352029Z", "elapsed_seconds": 160.609, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T09:02:14.959030+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "2b89f273036f690bcb8ed430f7567d4a5c074510fa581c5502f5c5302ce00d12", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": 